- **Thread Safety**: Mutexes (`pthread_mutex_t`) ensure thread safety when accessing shared configuration data.

- **Memory Management**: Dynamic allocation with `malloc` ensures the program can handle up to 10,000 elements efficiently. Always free allocated memory to prevent leaks.

