This code provides a basic implementation of managing a dynamic list of LTE UE measurement reports in C. It includes custom memory allocation, thread safety with mutex locks, and test data population ensuring unique center frequencies within each report. Further enhancements can be made to handle more complex scenarios as per the constraints listed.']

